      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Basam Ahmed",
        "email": "219071866+BasamAhmed640@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-09-14T00:48:09Z"
      },
      "message": "Ask before resuming an unapproved Learn draft instead of doing nothing\n\nReopening a section with a saved, unapproved draft previously showed only a\nnotification, which looked like Scholar had stopped working. Interactive\nreopens now ask whether to continue preparing (bounded by the 20-minute and\nthree-round limits) or only show the draft. Explicit \"continue\" skips the\nquestion; headless reopens keep showing the draft without generation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
