  {
    "sha": "51e5a8a2e349295c02df6fddcde77b915e8e8eab",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOUTGiVdoAKDUxZTVhOGEyZTM0OTI5NWMwMmRmNmZkZGNkZTc3YjkxNWU4ZThlYWI",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Basam Ahmed",
        "email": "219071866+BasamAhmed640@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-09-14T00:36:14Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Basam Ahmed",
        "email": "219071866+BasamAhmed640@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-09-14T00:36:14Z"
      },
      "message": "Make Learn delivery stops sticky and bound preparation independently\n\nChat and extension-sent input no longer clear a delivery stop or reset\nreview-round budgets; only an explicit Scholar command activation does.\nReopening an unapproved draft selects the book without entering Learn, so\nordinary chat cannot resume preparation or reviews.\n\nThe tool controller now enforces the 20-minute preparation budget itself\n(active turn time, independent of the loading widget), refuses to start a\nreview round that cannot finish in the remaining time, passes the remaining\ntime to reviewers, and stops after four lessonComplete submissions rejected\nfor delivery gaps. A fourth review reservation and question-review prehooks\nalso respect the stop. Stop messages name the exact continue command.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
